r temperatures at various depths just minutes before an eruption was due. He eventually built a \"working model\" of a geyser in his lab using a basin and a long tube to prove his theory that pressure and boiling points were the triggers—a model still taught in geology today. Id X who is synonymous with a particular chemistry lab equipment in a way.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:39:41Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "bunsen", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:39:44Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "burner", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-30T18:39:50Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "KP gets it", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]